<title>SIERRA LEONE: Seven prostitutes drown off Sierra Leone.</title>
<headline>Seven prostitutes drown off Sierra Leone.</headline>
<dateline>FREETOWN 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven prostitutes drowned when their boat capsized off West Africa when they were on their way to tout for business on foreign trawlers, police and survivors said on Friday.</p>
<p>The seven women drowned on Tuesday when their small boat capsized in a storm off the town of Yeali Boya in Sierra Leone, they added. The boat was also carrying traders.</p>
</text>
